          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "CREATING, DESTROYING & DUPLICATING\n\nTo create a node: double click on the canvas and from the pop-up menu select the node that you would like to add.\n\nAssignment: create a Rhombus node and a Star node\n\nTo destroy a node: select the node and use either the delete or backspace keys to destroy the node.\n\nAssignment: destroy the Star\n\nTo duplicate a node: hold the ALT/OPTION key to drag out a copy.\n\nAssignment: duplicate the Rhombus node."
          }
        },
