            "value": "CONNECTING & DISCONNECTING\n\nNodes can be connected to each other by clicking on an outlet and then on another node's inlet. Wire will draw a cord between them.\n\nAssignment: connect the output of the Sine to the inlets of the Rhombus node.\n\nNodes can be disconnected by clicking on a cord and hitting either the delete or backspace key.\n\nAssignment: break either connection to the Rhombus node."
